# RealmsRPG Project

**Stack:** Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind, Supabase, Vercel. No Prisma. Schema: `SUPABASE_SCHEMA.md`.

**Dirs:** `src/app/`, `src/components/{ui,shared,...}/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/stores/`, `src/lib/`, `src/services/`.

**Agent OS:** `ARCHITECTURE_CONSTITUTION.md` · tasks `ACTIVE_TASKS.md` · SoT map in root `AGENTS.md`.

**Before PR / push to master:** `npm run build` + `npm run tasks:validate` (strict reconcile needs `TASK-###` in commit subjects; `related_files` paths must exist). UI gates: lint/contrast/build + visual/a11y.
